<title>USA: VAALCO names Robert Gerry CEO, chairman.</title>
<headline>VAALCO names Robert Gerry CEO, chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>VAALCO Energy Inc said Friday that Robert  Gerry would replace Charles Alcorn as chairman and chief executive,  effective immediately.</p>
<p>Gerry was previously vice chairman of Nuevo Energy Co .</p>
<p>VAALCO said Alcorn would continue to pursue business opportunities  for VAALCO and remain a company director.</p>
</text>
